  "description": "Inventory of every corpus generator and verifier in this repo. Gated by scripts/check-generators.py so a new generator cannot be added without an entry, and an entry cannot claim coverage it does not have. `corpus` records which slice the process reads: full (all 1328 machines) or regression (the 20-machine subset in RealityEngine_CI/config/regression-corpus.txt)."
